			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4811454">
									

<p>There's a question about &quot;When Day Breaks&quot; that keeps occurring to me on and off again as well: What becomes of SCP-179, she appears to think of the Sun as her brother, after all and has a history of pointing to incoming dangers to the world for Foundation observatories to detect.</p>
<p>I've wondered for a while if she pointed to the sun just before it did&#8230; whatever it did. Or if now her purpose has changed and she's herding further disasters planetside&#8230; or even if something even worse befell her when the sun's light touched this humanoid entity in the middle of the cold vacuum of space.</p>

